+
+## What was done
+
+`add`, `rename` and `tag` now validate their input and return an `invalid-input` error (nothing changes)
+for: a blank title, a title over 120 characters (after trimming), a priority other than low/normal/high,
+and an empty tag or a tag containing whitespace. Tags given to `add` are checked too. Validators are in
+`src/domain/task.ts`; tests in `test/list.test.ts` ("input validation").
